This repository holds three different kinds of work, and they are NOT under
one licence. Read the part that covers what you want to use.

Until 2026-09-20 this file was CC0 1.0, which dedicated everything here to the
public domain. That was a mistake: it contradicted the site's own editorial
policy, which reserves the illustrations and clips. A public-domain dedication
cannot be withdrawn from anyone who already relied on it, so this licence
governs use from 2026-09-20 onwards.

The authoritative statement of reuse terms is the site's editorial policy,
published at https://easybone.org/editorial-policy (Thai) and
https://easybone.org/en/editorial-policy (English). Where this file and
that page differ, that page is the one that governs.

